<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar experts to discuss French cane aid.</title>
<headline>EU sugar experts to discuss French cane aid.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union sugar experts will exchange views on Wednesday on aid to cane producers in French overseas territories, an EU offcial said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Committee will hold a routine meeting to decide weekly tenders and molasses import duties apart for this one discussion item,&quot; the official said. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
